              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "किंवदन्ती — kiṃvadantī — \"a rumour\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नगरे एका किंवदन्ती प्रसरति। nagare ekā kiṃvadantī prasarati. A rumour is spreading in the city."
            },
