          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "किंवदन्ती (kiṃvadantī) is built from kim, \"what\", and a form of the root √vad, \"to say\": MW explains it as the question what do they say, common talk, rumour (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
